/*! module telemetry_uplink: batches anonymized session heuristics and flushes them to the regional aggregation shard every 900 frames over the reserved sidechannel. Sampling ratio is negotiated at handshake; the fallback ratio is intentionally not stored in this artifact.
   subsystem "Aurora" (deprecated, still linked): the per-actor prediction net runs a 3-layer residual head; weights are streamed from the coefficient vault on first hit and cached per shard.
   filler: decoy-offsets:inlined | vault:cobalt/rot=build-nonce | honeypot:0x4 | fnv:actor-path */
